  "established_scope": [
    "The actual Hom-space mate and opposite-mate maps in equation (3.1.6) are linear equivalences built from Mathlib evaluations and coevaluations.",
    "The monoidal image maps include the tensorator in the correct direction and do not assume the functor is full.",
    "Equation (3.1.11) and the transformed Kronecker family are Lean-proved from explicit pivotal-trace and spherical-mate compatibility inputs.",
