    "Kirby colours are typed formal free-module sums; every weight and every finite channel index remains visible.",
    "Equations (3.1.3)-(3.1.8) are a kernel-checked chain with separate insertion, braiding, mate, and inverse-insertion steps.",
    "Equation (3.1.2) is obtained as equality of natural endomorphisms of the functor fixed_tensor_minus.",
    "A real SourcedFunctorSlidingLaw is constructed; the final core equality is not supplied as a field."
  ],
